WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.605
Open Foundation School.

00:00:03.855 --> 00:00:06.532
Choose your assigned class and check the start date.

00:00:06.782 --> 00:00:08.838
Select the correct Sunday or week.

00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:12.012
For each student, select Present or Absent.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:15.333
The mark saves when you press the button, so

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:17.379
check the saved message before continuing.

00:00:17.629 --> 00:00:19.725
Unmarked is not the same as absent.

00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:22.824
If your class or a student is missing, ask

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:25.672
the Pastor to check the class assignment or enrolment.
